Subject: [PATCH 092/116] dt-bindings: display: msm: Add SM7250 MDSS

Add the SM7250 MDSS, DPU and DSI controller compatibles. The MDSS has a
third interconnect path for the CPU to register bus.

These changes were written with the help of an LLM and checked by a human.

